ec 15", "done": false}, {"week": 13, "text": "Target · December cash at or above $200k, final in the first week of January", "done": false}], "risks": [{"text": "More than a third of BNPL applications declined", "p": "medium", "i": "medium", "fix": "Signing a second provider for lower credit profiles becomes the first priority", "owner": "amin"}, {"text": "Less than $100k collected by Dec 15", "p": "medium", "i": "medium", "fix": "Follow-up pipeline becomes the first priority, never a discount", "owner": "amin"}, {"text": "Fewer than 80% of a week’s yeses paid within 24 hours", "p": "medium", "i": "medium", "fix": "Review the payment step the same week", "owner": "amin"}, {"text": "December needs about 115 qualified calls: about $57k of ads at $500 per qualified live call (KR 2.2), not the ~$35k first planned", "p": "medium", "i": "medium", "fix": "Budget December ads on $500 per qualified live call; keeps cost per sale at or under $1,500 at the 35% close rate (KR 3.2)", "owner": "amin"}]}'::jsonb)
