 "i": "medium", "fix": "Amin listens to all of them that week", "owner": "amin"}, {"text": "Rate still below 25% four weeks after qualification is locked", "p": "medium", "i": "medium", "fix": "Coaching becomes the first priority", "owner": "sales"}, {"text": "A December deal flagged as forced, or refunds rising with the rate", "p": "medium", "i": "medium", "fix": "Review the cause at the next weekly review, before any new sales initiative (KR 3.3)", "owner": "romain"}]}'::jsonb)
